{"meta":{"id":"err:1608320120","type":"series","name":"Tervist!","poster":"https://s.err.ee/photo/crop/2024/06/04/2425850hb3det80.jpg","background":"https://s.err.ee/photo/crop/2021/08/27/1124090h209ct48.jpg","genres":["Saated"],"description":"Uues saatesarjas läheb Katrin Viirpalu haiglatesse, kliinikutesse ja perearstikeskustesse, et mõista Eesti inimeste küsimusi ning muresid, millega arsti poole pöördutakse. Koostöös spetsialistidega avatakse erinevate tervisemurede olemust, otsitakse vastuseid ja kummutatakse ka väärarusaamu. Igas saates on fookuses erinevad tervisehäired. Nii räägib perearst Diana Ingerainen avasaates terviseärevusest, mis tabab globaalse tervisekriisi ajastul järjest suuremat hulka inimesi. Režissöör Rauno Viltrop, toimetaja Anne Mäns, produtsent Rait Roland Veskemaa.","videos":[{"id":"err:1608319490","title":"Tervist!","season":1,"episode":1,"thumbnail":"https://s.err.ee/photo/crop/2021/08/27/1124090hca88t34.jpg","released":"2021-08-26"},{"id":"err:1608326810","title":"Tervist!","season":1,"episode":2,"thumbnail":"https://s.err.ee/photo/crop/2021/08/27/1124090hca88t34.jpg","released":"2021-09-02"},{"id":"err:1608334046","title":"Tervist!","season":1,"episode":3,"thumbnail":"https://s.err.ee/photo/crop/2021/08/27/1124090hca88t34.jpg","released":"2021-09-09"},{"id":"err:1608349073","title":"Tervist!","season":1,"episode":4,"thumbnail":"https://s.err.ee/photo/crop/2021/08/27/1124090hca88t34.jpg","released":"2021-09-23"},{"id":"err:1608355787","title":"Tervist!","season":1,"episode":5,"thumbnail":"https://s.err.ee/photo/crop/2021/08/27/1124090hca88t34.jpg","released":"2021-09-30"},{"id":"err:1608363534","title":"Tervist!","season":1,"episode":6,"thumbnail":"https://s.err.ee/photo/crop/2021/08/27/1124090hca88t34.jpg","released":"2021-10-08"},{"id":"err:1608370401","title":"Tervist!","season":1,"episode":7,"thumbnail":"https://s.err.ee/photo/crop/2021/08/27/1124090hca88t34.jpg","released":"2021-10-14"},{"id":"err:1608378035","title":"Tervist!","se